---
import Layout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Method — Hydon BAI Studio" description="Hydon BAI Method: To create the unrepeatable through a repeatable mechanism.">
  <main class="reader">

    <!-- 1. Hero Statement -->
    <section class="sec-hero">
      <p class="sec-label">Method</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Hydon BAI Method</h1>
      <p class="hero-line-cn">
        在可复制的机制中，<br />创造不可复制的结果。
      </p>
      <p class="hero-line-en">
        A deterministic image-generation system<br />built through irreversible transfer processes.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-core">
        The image exists<br />in the act of disappearance.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 2. Deterministic Monotype -->
    <section class="sec-mono">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">Deterministic Monotype</h2>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">确定性独幅版画</p>
        <p class="mono-title">Deterministic Monotype</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">传统的 monotype 迷恋偶然。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">Hydon BAI Method 则试图抵抗它。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Traditional monotype embraces accident.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Hydon BAI Method resists it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">它并不追求不可控的墨迹效果，<br/>而是通过极端的手工控制，<br/>重新建立图像。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Instead of pursuing unpredictability,<br/>the image is reconstructed through<br/>extreme manual control.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">每一处色调变化、<br/>每一道纹理、<br/>每一束光，<br/>都在压印之前被重新建立。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Every tonal transition,<br/>every texture,<br/>every trace of light<br/>is physically rebuilt before transfer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block mono-block-last">
        <p class="mono-cn">过程或许可以重复。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">但图像不能。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">The process may be repeatable.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">The image is not.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 3. Process -->
    <section class="sec-process">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">Process</h2>

      <div class="process-stage">
        <div class="process-image">
          <img src={`${base}/images/method/incision.jpg`} alt="Incision" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="process-note">
          <p class="process-num">01</p>
          <p class="process-title">Incision</p>
          <p class="process-desc">在亚克力板上建立物理轮廓。雕塑逻辑第一次进入图像生成。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-stage">
        <div class="process-image">
          <img src={`${base}/images/method/saturation.jpg`} alt="Saturation" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="process-note">
          <p class="process-num">02</p>
          <p class="process-title">Saturation</p>
          <p class="process-desc">整版覆黑。图像进入&ldquo;潜像&rdquo;状态。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-stage">
        <div class="process-image">
          <img src={`${base}/images/method/reconstruction.jpg`} alt="Reconstruction" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="process-note">
          <p class="process-num">03</p>
          <p class="process-title">Reconstruction</p>
          <p class="process-desc">通过手工重新建立光影、纹理与细节。图像不是被印刷，而是被重新创造。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-stage">
        <div class="process-image">
          <img src={`${base}/images/method/transfer.png`} alt="Transfer" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="process-note">
          <p class="process-num">04</p>
          <p class="process-title">Transfer</p>
          <p class="process-desc">覆纸压印。图像进入不可逆的转化过程。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-stage">
        <div class="process-image">
          <img src={`${base}/images/method/disappearance.jpg`} alt="Disappearance" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <div class="process-note">
          <p class="process-num">05</p>
          <p class="process-title">Disappearance</p>
          <p class="process-desc">压印完成后，板上的手工痕迹被物理性破坏。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="process-whisper">The image survives only through disappearance.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 4. The Act of Disappearance -->
    <section class="sec-disappearance">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">The Act of Disappearance</h2>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">图像并不是被保存下来的。它是被&ldquo;牺牲&rdquo;出来的。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">The image is not preserved. It is sacrificed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">每一道被重新建立的痕迹，都只存在一次。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Every reconstructed mark exists only once.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">它存在于：压印发生之前。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">For the duration before transfer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">当压力降临，图像便开始消失。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">The moment pressure is applied, the image begins to disappear.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">留在板上的，是损耗。留在纸上的，才成为作品。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">What remains on the plate is loss. What remains on paper becomes the image.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block mono-block-last">
        <p class="mono-cn">Hydon BAI Method 并不抵抗消失。它通过消失，创造唯一性。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Hydon BAI Method does not resist disappearance. It creates uniqueness through disappearance.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 5. Post-Digital Aura -->
    <section class="sec-aura">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">Post-Digital Aura</h2>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">在数字时代，<br />图像可以被无限复制。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">完美地复制。<br />瞬间地复制。<br />没有损耗地复制。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">In the digital age,<br />images can be copied endlessly.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Perfectly.<br />Instantly.<br />Without resistance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">Hydon BAI Method<br />却选择了相反的方向。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Hydon BAI Method<br />moves in the opposite direction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">它利用复制的逻辑，<br />重新夺回唯一性。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">It uses the logic of reproduction<br />to recover singularity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">图像不再是无限的。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">它重新变得：<br />不可逆。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">The image is no longer infinite.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">It becomes irreversible again.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">每一次压印，<br />都会带来损耗。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Every transfer<br />contains loss.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block">
        <p class="mono-cn">每一件作品，<br />都诞生于一次消失。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">Every image<br />is born through disappearance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mono-block mono-block-last">
        <p class="mono-cn">也正因如此，<br />图像重新获得了：</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">重量。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">存在。</p>
        <p class="mono-cn">灵光。</p>
        <p class="mono-en">And precisely because of this,<br />the image regains:</p>
        <p class="mono-en">weight.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">presence.</p>
        <p class="mono-en">aura.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 6. Beyond Printmaking -->
    <section class="sec-beyond">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">Beyond Printmaking</h2>

      <div class="beyond-fragment">
        <p class="beyond-cn">Hydon BAI Method<br />并不属于传统意义上的版画。</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn">它同样不是绘画。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">Hydon BAI Method<br />does not fully belong<br />to traditional printmaking.</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">Nor is it simply painting.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-fragment">
        <p class="beyond-cn">它更接近一种：<br />图像生成系统。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">It is closer to<br />an image-generation system.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-fragment">
        <p class="beyond-cn">雕塑的空间逻辑，</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn">油画的光影控制，</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn">版画的压印机制，</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn beyond-cn-last">在同一个过程中被重新组织。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">The spatial logic of sculpture,</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">the tonal control of painting,</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">and the transfer mechanism of printmaking</p>
        <p class="beyond-en beyond-en-last">are reorganized within a single process.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-fragment">
        <p class="beyond-cn">图像不再来自单一媒介。</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn beyond-cn-last">它诞生于：<br />媒介之间。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">The image no longer emerges<br />from a single medium.</p>
        <p class="beyond-en beyond-en-last">It exists<br />between mediums.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-fragment">
        <p class="beyond-cn">在传统版画中，<br />&ldquo;复制&rdquo;意味着复数。</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn beyond-cn-last">而在 Hydon BAI Method 中，<br />复制机制本身，<br />反而成为了唯一性的来源。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">In traditional printmaking,<br />reproduction implies multiplicity.</p>
        <p class="beyond-en beyond-en-last">Within Hydon BAI Method,<br />the reproductive mechanism itself<br />becomes the source of singularity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-fragment beyond-fragment-last">
        <p class="beyond-cn">它并不是在扩展版画。</p>
        <p class="beyond-cn beyond-cn-last">而是在重新讨论：<br />图像如何诞生。</p>
        <p class="beyond-en">It does not merely extend printmaking.</p>
        <p class="beyond-en beyond-en-last">It reconsiders<br />how images come into existence.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-rule"></div>

    <!-- 7. Manifesto -->
    <section class="sec-manifesto">
      <h2 class="sec-heading">Manifesto</h2>

      <div class="manifesto-fragment">
        <p class="manifesto-cn">在这个可以无限复制图像的时代，</p>
        <p class="manifesto-cn manifesto-cn-last">我们仍然选择：<br />缓慢、<br />手工、<br />损耗、<br />以及不可逆。</p>
        <p class="manifesto-en">In an age of infinite reproduction,</p>
        <p class="manifesto-en manifesto-en-last">we still choose:<br />slowness,<br />manual labor,<br />erosion,<br />and irreversibility.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto-fragment">
        <p class="manifesto-cn manifesto-cn-last">因为有些图像，<br />只能诞生一次。</p>
        <p class="manifesto-en manifesto-en-last">Because some images<br />should only exist once.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="manifesto-final">Like life itself.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="reader-end">
      <a href={`${base}/method/essay`} class="essay-link">
        <span class="essay-link-label">Read Full Essay</span>
        <span class="essay-link-desc">The Image That Disappears: Notes on the Hydon BAI Method</span>
        <span class="essay-link-arrow">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .reader {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: calc(var(--spacing-xl) + 2rem) var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  /* === 1. Hero Statement === */
  .sec-hero {
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-xl) + 2rem);
  }

  .sec-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .hero-line-cn {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .hero-line-en {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .hero-core {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  /* === Section headings === */
  .sec-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* === 2. Deterministic Monotype === */
  .sec-mono,
  .sec-disappearance,
  .sec-aura {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .mono-block {
    padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .mono-block:first-of-type {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .mono-block-last {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .mono-title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mono-cn {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .mono-en {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* === 3. Process === */
  .sec-process {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .process-stage {
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-xl) + 2rem);
  }

  .process-stage:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .process-image {
    margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--spacing-md)) var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .process-image img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    background: #eaeaea;
  }

  .process-note {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .process-num {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .process-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .process-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .process-whisper {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.5;
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* === 6. Beyond Printmaking === */
  .sec-beyond {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .beyond-fragment {
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .beyond-fragment-last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .beyond-cn {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 2;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .beyond-cn-last {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .beyond-en {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .beyond-en-last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* === 7. Manifesto === */
  .sec-manifesto {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .manifesto-fragment {
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .manifesto-cn {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 2.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-cn-last {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .manifesto-en {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-en-last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-final {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* === Dividers === */
  .reader-rule {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: var(--spacing-lg) auto;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .reader-end {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: calc(var(--spacing-xl) + 2rem) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .essay-link {
    display: block;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .essay-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-text);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text);
  }

  .essay-link-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .essay-link-desc {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .essay-link-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* === Mobile === */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .reader {
      padding: calc(var(--spacing-lg) + 3rem) var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.75rem);
    }

    .hero-line-cn {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }

    .process-image {
      margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--spacing-sm));
      margin-right: calc(-1 * var(--spacing-sm));
    }

    .process-note,
    .sec-mono,
    .sec-disappearance,
    .sec-aura,
    .sec-beyond,
    .sec-manifesto {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
